54-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-GHotR-p154_9-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brian_R._James\" title=\"Brian R. James\">Brian R. James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>&#160;(September 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_History_of_the_Realms\" title=\"The Grand History of the Realms\">The Grand History of the Realms</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Penny_Williams\" title=\"Penny Williams\">Penny Williams</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 154. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\">978-0-7869-4731-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-VGttD-p105-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-VGttD-p105_10-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>&#160;(January 1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Guide_to_the_Dalelands\" title=\"Volo's Guide to the Dalelands\">Volo's Guide to the Dalelands</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 105. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0406-2\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0406-2\">0-7869-0406-2</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-volo-11\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-volo_11-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>&#160;(January 1996). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Volo%27s_Guide_to_the_Dalelands\" title=\"Volo's Guide to the Dalelands\">Volo's Guide to the Dalelands</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 95. ISBN&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-0406-2\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-0406-2